# Replaced 2026-09-04: the old inline entry failed silently for 3 months.
# It used sudo (no NOPASSWD -> fails in cron) and omitted --min-validity
# (so tailscale cert returned the cached cert instead of renewing).
# Weekly, not monthly: a monthly job that fails has no retry before expiry.
# 5am not 4am to avoid racing watchtower, which restarts containers Sundays at 4.
0 5 * * 0 /home/pramod/code/homelab/projects/certs-backup/renew_certs.sh
*/5 * * * * /home/pramod/code/homelab/projects/tinxy-watchdog/watchdog_tinxy.sh >> /home/pramod/code/homelab/tinxy-watchdog.log 2>&1
